Thanks for doing the "replicate" experiment.  I'm still not happy with the CI estimates produced at the survey level.  Yes, they will be large, but not 0 to infinity.  I note that the degrees of freedom associated with each of those survey-specific estimates are weird (0.10, 0.008, ...) that can't be right.  Are you willing to send along the data (privately, not to the group) so we can further investigate?

